<title>JAPAN: Bank of Kinki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Kinki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    44.19		vs	   54.92</p>
<p> Operating	    7.11		vs	    8.19</p>
<p> Current		1.69		vs	    2.91</p>
<p> Net		    1.61		vs	    1.24</p>
<p> EPS		    7.76 yen	  vs	    5.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     208 million	 vs	  208 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.00 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Kinki Ltd is an Osaka-based regional bank.</p>
